  "constitutionalAuthorityStatementText": "<pre>\n[Congressional Record Volume 169, Number 147 (Tuesday, September 12, 2023)]\n[House]\nFrom the Congressional Record Online through the Government Publishing Office [<a href=\"https://www.gpo.gov\">www.gpo.gov</a>]\nBy Mr. LANDSMAN:\nH.R. 5385.\nCongress has the power to enact this legislation pursuant\nto the following:\nArticle I, Section 8, Clause 3\nThe single subject of this legislation is:\nThe Medicare PBM Accountability Act would require more\ntransparency for pharmacy benefit managers when contracting\nwith Medicare-related prescription drug plans.\n[Page H4264]\n</pre>",
